 2) POWER ARITHMETIC (variance-excess estimator): why 23 in-hand carriers = NO-GO
================================================================================================
 Estimator: excess variance of matched-a_ext carrier sigmas over the measurement+FJ floor.
 z ~ (s*p)^2 / (eps_eff^2 * sqrt(2/N)),  eps_eff = sqrt(eps_meas^2 + eps_FJ^2)
 (s = true spread, p = infall-phase classification purity ~0.6, N = carriers).

     s    p eps_meas eps_FJ |  z(N=23) |  N(3sig)  N(5sig)
 --------------------------------------------------------------
